---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Panel from '../../components/Panel.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../config';
---
<Base title="About">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1 class="display">ABOUT</h1>
    <p>I'm Aritra, a third-year BDes student in Immersive Digital Environments at O.P. Jindal Global University, designing games and spaces people can step into.</p>
    <p>I like to start with a question, then research, prototype, get critiqued and iterate. Tiger Run grew out of a Grade 10 drawing about wildlife conservation. SoleSync began with a trust problem in buying sneakers and ended as a prototype I critiqued three times. My environment and lighting work comes from studying how real light behaves, then rebuilding it in Maya and Unreal Engine.</p>
    <p>Outside the studio I photograph wildlife as @wildscapeexplorers. I'm looking for an internship in game design, immersive environments or UX, where I can learn fast and contribute to real production work.</p>
    <p>{SITE.programme}.</p>
    <Panel variant="indigo" label="PLAYER STATS">
      <p><strong>Areas:</strong> game + environment, UX + systems, motion + lighting</p>
      <p><strong>Tools:</strong> Maya · SketchUp · Unreal Engine · Figma · Google Stitch · Procreate · Blender (basic) · AutoCAD (basic)</p>
    </Panel>
    <h2 class="h2" id="photography">Wildlife photography</h2>
    <Panel variant="indigo" label="@WILDSCAPEEXPLORERS">
      <p>Aritra photographs wildlife as @wildscapeexplorers, the same concern for animals and habitat that sits behind Tiger Run.</p>
      <p><a class="btn btn--primary" href={SITE.instagramFeatured} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">SEE THE FIRST POST →</a></p>
      <p><a href={SITE.instagram} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open the full Instagram profile</a></p>
    </Panel>
    <h2 class="h2" id="build">How this site was made</h2>
    <Panel variant="pink" label="BUILD NOTE">
      <p>This website was <strong>coded with Claude</strong>, an AI assistant from Anthropic. Claude is the enabler: it wrote the code.</p>
      <p>Everything that makes the site what it is comes from <strong>Aritra Mitra</strong>: the strategy, the information architecture, the arcade design system and its link to his printed card, the choice of work, and the full specification Claude built to.</p>
      <p class="muted">Research data in SoleSync is simulated for coursework. Images and decks are Aritra's own work from his BDes programme.</p>
    </Panel>
  </div>
</Base>
